lunasvg / plutovg fixes for nitroview (scripts/get-deps.sh applies this after downloading):
- plutovg_path_parse rejected a repeated closepath ("ZZ", valid SVG) and dropped the rest of
  the path (https://github.com/sammycage/plutovg/pull/90)
- mask and clip-path layers were as large as the whole element on the target (not clipped to
  it like group layers): zoomed in far, huge allocations, then a crash
- plutovg_surface_create cleared height * stride bytes computed in int (overflow above 2 GB)

--- a/plutovg/source/plutovg-path.c
+++ b/plutovg/source/plutovg-path.c
@@ -902,9 +902,8 @@
             current_x = values[3];
             current_y = values[4];
         } else if(command == 'Z' || command == 'z') {
-            if(last_command == 'Z' || last_command == 'z')
-                return false;
-            plutovg_path_close(path);
+            if(last_command != 'Z' && last_command != 'z')
+                plutovg_path_close(path); // a repeated closepath is valid and changes nothing
             current_x = start_x;
             current_y = start_y;
         } else {
--- a/plutovg/source/plutovg-surface.c
+++ b/plutovg/source/plutovg-surface.c
